No one else has ever seen me like that before.

275
00:14:01,340 --> 00:14:02,360
Only you.

276
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:07,160
And if you don't want the police to find out, then I suggest you get to work.

277
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:09,700
You're making outfits for Juju now!

278
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:13,800
Huh?

279
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:16,100
Juju?

280
00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:19,520
Her name is Juju.

281
00:14:19,760 --> 00:14:21,360
Isn't she offensively cute?

282
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:22,900
I'm basically obsessed with her.

283
00:14:24,900 --> 00:14:26,120
I know that name.

284
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:28,720
She's the cosplayer that Kitagawa said she liked.

285
00:14:29,020 --> 00:14:30,500
But is that really her?

286
00:14:30,900 --> 00:14:31,140
Huh?

287
00:14:32,140 --> 00:14:32,420
Uh?

288
00:14:32,420 --> 00:14:33,220
Oh!

289
00:14:34,220 --> 00:14:34,660
Wow.

290
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:36,340
She looks really young, though.

291
00:14:36,860 --> 00:14:38,060
How old do you think she is?

292
00:14:38,300 --> 00:14:38,700
Hmm.

293
00:14:39,060 --> 00:14:40,260
She might be in middle school.

294
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,660
Or at the end of grade school.

295
00:14:43,620 --> 00:14:45,100
Please forgive my ignorance.

296
00:14:45,460 --> 00:14:46,260
About what?

297
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:48,120
So, tell me, Juju.

298
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:49,800
What brings you here?

299
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:52,180
And how did you find out where I lived?

300
00:14:53,940 --> 00:14:55,580
Well, I, uh...

301
00:14:55,580 --> 00:15:01,120
I saw that marine girl's cosplay photo going around online, and...

302
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:01,480
Huh?

303
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:03,360
Who the heck's this?

304
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:07,560
She tweeted that she was going to a cosplay event after that.

305
00:15:07,760 --> 00:15:10,420
So I went because I wanted to see her outfit up close.

306
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:12,180
And then...

307
00:15:12,180 --> 00:15:13,700
And I feel like I'm about to burst!

308
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:15,120
Yeah, you probably are!

309
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:17,580
That outfit was measured in sewn to fit you perfectly!

310
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:20,680
When I found out you were the one who made it,

311
00:15:21,100 --> 00:15:24,020
they went to a little stalker sauce and followed you home.

312
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:24,960
I'm sorry.

313
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:27,460
These cosplayers are nuts!

314
00:15:27,460 --> 00:15:33,600
For real?

315
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:35,820
This is Sajuna Inui.

316
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:37,560
Bro, don't go telling her my real name!

317
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:39,140
I use a cosplay name for a reason!

318
00:15:39,140 --> 00:15:41,400
My Juju's name is Sajuna?

319
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,840
You're why I'm that cute!

320
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:46,460
My name is Marin Kitagawa, and I'm obsessed with everything you do!

321
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:47,580
I love you so much!

322
00:15:47,700 --> 00:15:48,660
I'm your biggest fan!

323
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:49,740
Too close!

324
00:15:49,820 --> 00:15:52,520
Gee, you're just as gorgeous in person as you are in your photos!

325
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:53,520
You're so cute!

326
00:15:54,100 --> 00:15:54,960
And look at your skin!

327
00:15:55,300 --> 00:15:56,220
Who does your hair?

328
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,900
Wait, is Juju short for Sajuna?

329
00:15:57,900 --> 00:16:00,420
Look, I didn't pick the name, it's just...

330
00:16:00,420 --> 00:16:03,260
Actually, Inui told me she saw your cosplay photos, Kitagawa.

331
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:04,280
That's why she's here.

332
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:10,880
This cosplay goddess saw my pics?

333
00:16:11,020 --> 00:16:11,900
She looked at me!

334
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:16,360
You have no idea how excited it makes me, Juju!

335
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:18,060
Holy crap, you really know I exist!

336
00:16:18,220 --> 00:16:20,320
It probably popped up because you follow me online!

337
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:22,020
Now get out of my personal space!

338
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:23,400
I can't handle this like at all!

339
00:16:23,820 --> 00:16:25,280
Neither can I, you're too close!

340
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:26,900
I'm not here for you, moron!

341
00:16:26,900 --> 00:16:30,600
I'm trying to get hooked up with one of Wakana Gojo's custom outfits, so move!

342
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:33,160
Oh my god, you have like the prettiest eyes!

343
00:16:33,180 --> 00:16:34,100
What's wrong with you?

344
00:16:37,140 --> 00:16:38,320
So what do you think?

345
00:16:39,180 --> 00:16:39,740
Are you in?

346
00:16:39,980 --> 00:16:43,100
I need you to make Shionikaido's black lily outfit for me!

347
00:16:43,460 --> 00:16:44,500
What? Shionton?

348
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:46,260
Wait, that girl you showed me?

349
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,320
The one with the blue dress?

350
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:47,940
Yep!

351
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:50,400
Shionton from Flower Princess Blaze!

352
00:16:50,540 --> 00:16:52,380
It's popular with young girls, you've seen it?

353
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:53,800
I don't watch much anime.

354
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:57,760
Princess Lily!

355
00:16:57,760 --> 00:17:03,900
Like she said, Shionikaido is a character who appears in the shoujo anime Flower Princess Blaze.

356
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:08,300
She and the protagonist Mirai decide to fight together by becoming the Flower Princess Magical Girl.

357
00:17:09,140 --> 00:17:10,880
And that's the end of you!

358
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:13,880
Never again will you stand before the proud lily!

359
00:17:14,140 --> 00:17:15,060
Magical girl!

360
00:17:15,060 --> 00:17:17,820
Princess Lily!

361
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:20,480
But then...

362
00:17:21,020 --> 00:17:22,660
No! It can't be true!

363
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:25,440
This whole time I've been fighting my sister?

364
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:28,760
She finds out that her older sister Neon is actually the enemy.

365
00:17:29,100 --> 00:17:30,080
But how could you?

366
00:17:30,500 --> 00:17:31,360
We're sisters!

367
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:34,220
This flower is totally opening up to you!

368
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:35,300
Xion!

369
00:17:35,300 --> 00:17:37,100
Xion, we know the truth is cruel.

370
00:17:37,900 --> 00:17:40,500
And the truth is happiness doesn't last forever.

371
00:17:41,820 --> 00:17:43,600
Our false family.

372
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:45,960
The people who always look down on us.

373
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:48,100
Is it truly who you fought for?

374
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:49,820
Who you wanted to protect?

375
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:51,300
No!

376
00:17:52,120 --> 00:17:53,380
Please stop!

377
00:17:54,060 --> 00:17:56,360
What I wanted was destruction.

378
00:17:57,640 --> 00:18:00,000
I want to destroy you all.

379
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:00,420
Please!

380
00:18:00,420 --> 00:18:00,720
Please!

381
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:02,220
No!

382
00:18:05,340 --> 00:18:06,280
Uh-oh!

383
00:18:06,620 --> 00:18:07,660
Here comes Black Lily!

384
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:09,260
We've got trouble!

385
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:14,920
Tell the truth.

386
00:18:15,220 --> 00:18:17,420
You wanted to ruin everything, didn't you?

387
00:18:18,860 --> 00:18:22,200
You wanted a world that matched the hue of your heart.

388
00:18:22,520 --> 00:18:24,560
As dark as the abyss.

389
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:27,080
Oh my god, the drama!

390
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:32,580
Neon was originally created as an enemy after her flower jewel was tainted from the shock of a broken heart.

391
00:18:32,900 --> 00:18:34,140
It's so unbelievably tragic.

392
00:18:34,140 --> 00:18:35,500
Because she does know her stuff.

393
00:18:35,600 --> 00:18:42,000
I thought she was the type that fanned over what's popular without researching anything about the original work and just cosplay characters because their outfits were cute.

394
00:18:42,780 --> 00:18:43,880
Heartbreak is no joke.

395
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:46,340
Sounds like Neon had a pretty bad case of it.

396
00:18:46,540 --> 00:18:47,460
She totally did.

397
00:18:48,180 --> 00:18:51,200
It turned out that two of her childhood guy friends were secretly dating.

398
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:51,580
Huh?

399
00:18:51,580 --> 00:18:55,720
I mean, it's not officially written anywhere, but if you're paying attention, it's super obvious.

400
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:56,380
Yep.

401
00:18:56,900 --> 00:18:58,240
100% can confirm.

402
00:18:58,780 --> 00:19:00,540
The relationships in Blaze are complicated.

403
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:03,880
Mirai and Shion Tan are super in love with this dude, Sakuya.

404
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:05,740
They actually hardcore fight over him.

405
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:09,640
But Sakuya is totally dating Soma, so those crushes were doomed from the start.

406
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:12,380
And let's not forget that Neon had it bad for Soma, too.

407
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:13,980
Oh, yeah, that's crazy.

408
00:19:14,300 --> 00:19:14,960
Kids watch this?

409
00:19:15,100 --> 00:19:16,660
Shion is a genius, by the way.

410
00:19:17,100 --> 00:19:19,160
She's just messed up because she had a rough life.

411
00:19:19,160 --> 00:19:21,740
But that doesn't get her down.

412
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:27,840
The fact that she's always smiling like she's tricked someone no matter what is what made me love her more than any of the other magical girls.

413
00:19:28,780 --> 00:19:30,500
So, yeah, I have to cosplay her.

414
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:34,760
But even if you buy the official Black Lily outfit, it's super difficult to alter.

415
00:19:35,580 --> 00:19:38,800
That's why I want you to make a custom one for me that fits perfectly.

416
00:19:41,120 --> 00:19:43,300
My sweet juju is gonna be Black Lily?

417
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:45,040
I would kill to see that.

418
00:19:45,540 --> 00:19:47,740
As you can tell, Kitagawa loves Shion, too.

419
00:19:47,740 --> 00:19:49,500
She even has her all over her bag.

420
00:19:49,820 --> 00:19:52,220
Well, if you like her so much, then why don't you cosplay her?

421
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:54,640
Oh, no, I'd rather not do that.

422
00:19:54,940 --> 00:19:55,440
Why not?

423
00:19:56,020 --> 00:19:56,880
I'm way too tall.

424
00:19:57,160 --> 00:20:00,260
Not to mention I'm pretty far off from Shiontan's small and delicate demeanor.

425
00:20:00,760 --> 00:20:04,600
Although I do believe it's okay to ignore all that and just cosplay the characters you love anyway.

426
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:08,700
But in my case, I love her so much I don't want to destroy her image.

427
00:20:09,220 --> 00:20:13,200
If I'm actually gonna cosplay someone, I'd want to do a good job with it.

428
00:20:13,680 --> 00:20:16,960
Besides, if it's Blaze, I'd totally want to be Neon.

429
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,460
What the hell is happening?

430
00:20:20,460 --> 00:20:22,140
Whatever, you're just stating the obvious!

431
00:20:23,100 --> 00:20:24,380
This sucks so bad.

432
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:27,380
She's exactly the kind of cosplayer I absolutely love.

433
00:20:27,540 --> 00:20:32,220
I hadn't heard of her before, so it seemed like she was just some idiot who didn't know what cosplaying actually was.

434
00:20:32,300 --> 00:20:33,420
But she does!

435
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:37,060
She's really not some annoying bitch at all, and I hate that!

436
00:20:37,300 --> 00:20:38,260
I'm so sorry!

437
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:40,100
Please forgive me!

438
00:20:40,100 --> 00:20:41,160
