439
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:47,560
Okay, I'm going home.

440
00:20:47,940 --> 00:20:51,240
Right. I'm sure your uniform is dry by now. I'll go grab it.

441
00:20:51,280 --> 00:20:51,940
Wakana Gojo.

442
00:20:52,620 --> 00:20:52,960
Yes?

443
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:58,140
Give me your contact information. I'll send you more info on Black Lily and my measurements.

444
